{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/432a0e1f2dfb95c4b1038f4915ae48aa.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/432a0e1f2dfb95c4b1038f4915ae48aa.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/432a0e1f2dfb95c4b1038f4915ae48aa.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange notebook lands on your desk. The words \u201clive sacrifices\u201d\u00a0and\u00a0\u201csummoning\u00a0ritual\u201d pull you into a murder case left cold for 22 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others gave up, but you won\u2019t. You believe every door has a key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the archives, secrets lie buried under mountains of dust. In the interrogation room, silence hides the ugliest truths. You\u2019ve been told this case is unsolvable, but obsession drives you to dig deeper until you find the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/3935dc57d272087cecf17cab0c59d4e6.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/3935dc57d272087cecf17cab0c59d4e6.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/3935dc57d272087cecf17cab0c59d4e6.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/825bea3ca707c6ca09d5d198d4f12cfb.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/825bea3ca707c6ca09d5d198d4f12cfb.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/825bea3ca707c6ca09d5d198d4f12cfb.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crime scene is full of silent clues. Inspect every object, texture, and detail for hidden marks or the slightest signs of tampering. Then, study the most crucial piece of evidence\u2014the body. Meticulously examine its position, wounds, and condition to surmise the circumstances surrounding the murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this seemingly scattered physical evidence may hold the key to what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026And every detail you miss could block your path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/e133de6e8cb84e9dd9c44bf91ccccd8f.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/e133de6e8cb84e9dd9c44bf91ccccd8f.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/e133de6e8cb84e9dd9c44bf91ccccd8f.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/65a2f963af072e331fe2e987f3b57b4e.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/65a2f963af072e331fe2e987f3b57b4e.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/65a2f963af072e331fe2e987f3b57b4e.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The suspects speak carefully; their words are measured, their stories perfectly polished. But you are watching something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does their tone shift upon speaking a certain name? Do their eyes flinch when shown a photo? A gesture, a pause, a flash of tension\u2014these are the true cracks in the story, and are more important than any words that leave their mouths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more flawless the alibi, the more likely it is to be concealing vital information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c821e3175c0d9cd036042d29ef27c705.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c821e3175c0d9cd036042d29ef27c705.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c821e3175c0d9cd036042d29ef27c705.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c80a7d2d266f655a1284913a0e5039d0.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c80a7d2d266f655a1284913a0e5039d0.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c80a7d2d266f655a1284913a0e5039d0.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twelve suspects, twelve signs. A trail of deaths woven together in a tangled web, full of deception and hidden motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death follows a twisted logic, their dates forming an unsolvable pattern. Even the burial sites are hidden behind puzzles published by the killer in the daily paper. Beneath layers of love and hatred, you uncover a tangle of buried connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trace their relationships, untangle their histories, and follow each thread to the heart of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/20fb2e78d653cf2e12420d5bec1158b5.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/20fb2e78d653cf2e12420d5bec1158b5.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/20fb2e78d653cf2e12420d5bec1158b5.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the story. Who to trust, what to believe, which evidence to follow\u2014each choice leads to a new ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One path reveals a tragic victim. Another exposes a manipulator in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you investigate, the more the lines blur between justice and judgment. Each ending peels back another layer of this tangled web, forcing you to confront the many faces of human nature and uncover how everything fell apart in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So you dive in again, revisiting each fork in the road and reopening every file. Because only by exploring every possible path can you expose the full story\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and all the secrets buried in the dark.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183600?t=1771813865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771813865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/7ca5efb3cb43ec72e8f0e33e7270da3a2891d866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771813865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/7ca5efb3cb43ec72e8f0e33e7270da3a2891d866/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771813865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3209150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/432a0e1f2dfb95c4b1038f4915ae48aa.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/432a0e1f2dfb95c4b1038f4915ae48aa.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/432a0e1f2dfb95c4b1038f4915ae48aa.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange notebook lands on your desk. The words \u201clive sacrifices\u201d\u00a0and\u00a0\u201csummoning\u00a0ritual\u201d pull you into a murder case left cold for 22 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others gave up, but you won\u2019t. You believe every door has a key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the archives, secrets lie buried under mountains of dust. In the interrogation room, silence hides the ugliest truths. You\u2019ve been told this case is unsolvable, but obsession drives you to dig deeper until you find the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/3935dc57d272087cecf17cab0c59d4e6.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/3935dc57d272087cecf17cab0c59d4e6.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/3935dc57d272087cecf17cab0c59d4e6.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/825bea3ca707c6ca09d5d198d4f12cfb.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/825bea3ca707c6ca09d5d198d4f12cfb.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/825bea3ca707c6ca09d5d198d4f12cfb.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crime scene is full of silent clues. Inspect every object, texture, and detail for hidden marks or the slightest signs of tampering. Then, study the most crucial piece of evidence\u2014the body. Meticulously examine its position, wounds, and condition to surmise the circumstances surrounding the murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this seemingly scattered physical evidence may hold the key to what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026And every detail you miss could block your path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/e133de6e8cb84e9dd9c44bf91ccccd8f.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/e133de6e8cb84e9dd9c44bf91ccccd8f.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/e133de6e8cb84e9dd9c44bf91ccccd8f.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/65a2f963af072e331fe2e987f3b57b4e.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/65a2f963af072e331fe2e987f3b57b4e.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/65a2f963af072e331fe2e987f3b57b4e.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The suspects speak carefully; their words are measured, their stories perfectly polished. But you are watching something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does their tone shift upon speaking a certain name? Do their eyes flinch when shown a photo? A gesture, a pause, a flash of tension\u2014these are the true cracks in the story, and are more important than any words that leave their mouths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more flawless the alibi, the more likely it is to be concealing vital information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c821e3175c0d9cd036042d29ef27c705.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c821e3175c0d9cd036042d29ef27c705.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c821e3175c0d9cd036042d29ef27c705.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c80a7d2d266f655a1284913a0e5039d0.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c80a7d2d266f655a1284913a0e5039d0.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/c80a7d2d266f655a1284913a0e5039d0.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twelve suspects, twelve signs. A trail of deaths woven together in a tangled web, full of deception and hidden motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death follows a twisted logic, their dates forming an unsolvable pattern. Even the burial sites are hidden behind puzzles published by the killer in the daily paper. Beneath layers of love and hatred, you uncover a tangle of buried connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trace their relationships, untangle their histories, and follow each thread to the heart of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/20fb2e78d653cf2e12420d5bec1158b5.poster.avif?t=1771813865\" width=970 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/20fb2e78d653cf2e12420d5bec1158b5.webm?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/extras/20fb2e78d653cf2e12420d5bec1158b5.mp4?t=1771813865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the story. Who to trust, what to believe, which evidence to follow\u2014each choice leads to a new ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One path reveals a tragic victim. Another exposes a manipulator in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you investigate, the more the lines blur between justice and judgment. Each ending peels back another layer of this tangled web, forcing you to confront the many faces of human nature and uncover how everything fell apart in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So you dive in again, revisiting each fork in the road and reopening every file. Because only by exploring every possible path can you expose the full story\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and all the secrets buried in the dark.</strong></p>","developers":["LazyBoy"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183600/header.jpg?t=1771813865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183600/1126048593/4517ca747ad8a46f2c7c9923a59a746ada85938f/1751961633/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751964650","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183600/1126048593/4517ca747ad8a46f2c7c9923a59a746ada85938f/1751961